OL,3,GNEWSATributes to man who died after
OL,4,Apunch bag machine landed on him
OL,5,
OL,6,FA father-of-five who died after a punch
OL,7,Fbag machine landed on him has been
OL,8,Fdescribed as a "friend to many" and "a
OL,9,Fman with a heart of gold".
OL,11,FAbdo Ali, 52, died after a disturbance
OL,12,Fat a row of shops on Berkley Street,
OL,13,FToxteth, on 29 October, Merseyside
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FOfficers were called following reports
OL,17,Fthat a punch bag machine had been
OL,18,Fpushed over and had landed on a
OL,19,Fbystander.
